Simplified the fallback to return the already-loaded `type` value and combined the profile pointer/bounds checks into one condition, reducing duplicate invalid returns and branches.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetType() const
{
    if ( type != FIT_UINT8_INVALID )
        return type;

    if ( (profile != NULL) && (profileIndex < profile->numFields) )
        return profile->fields[profileIndex].type;

    return type;
}
```